//===== Compatible With: =====================================
//= rAthena Project
//===== Description: =========================================
//= [Official Conversion]
//= Guides for the City of Morocc
//===== Additional Comments: =================================
//= 1.1 Now using duplicate command.
//= 1.2 Optimized, updated common guide names [Lupus]
//= 1.3 Removed Duplicates [Silent]
